  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1em; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181435/rss" title="yoopta.dev" style=" color: #3366aa;    font-size: 1.05em;"&gt;Yoopta Editor 6.0: A Headless Rich Text Editor for React&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — MIT-licensed library for creating block-based, Notion-style rich text editing experiences. It’s headless at heart, but comes with a variety of UI components to get started fast. &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181436/rss" style=" color: #3366aa;   "&gt;The playground&lt;/a&gt; offers a live example.&lt;/p&gt;
